# Explicit nested globs — bare `node_modules` / `.next` did not match the
# workspace's nested copies, and the dev server's Turbopack cache under
# apps/web/.next/dev is a single file well over Vercel's 100 MB limit.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
.turbo
**/.turbo
.git
.vercel

.env
.env.local
.env*.local
.storage
.devdb
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
